  "Genres": "Life Simulation",
  "Name": "The Galactic Aquarium",
  "Overview": "The Galactic Aquarium is a fun, addictive game that's easy to get into but hard to master! Try to breed all the different types of fish to get the daddy of them all, The Cod Father!\n\nWatch out for fish with special abilities, like the Chameeleon and the time warping Bronzefish, that can cause chaos in your fish tank! And try to manage what's eating what so you can make the most money and be top of the online scoreboard.\n\nWith over 40 different types of fish, you'll have to keep on your toes - or fins ;) - to keep your tank running smoothly. Luckily, you've got your handy breeding guide to help you along your way, and your freezer to store fish that are ready to breed.\n\nGood luck!",
  "Publisher": "GoGo-Robot",
